# wannado-drl Cursor Rule

Read `.agents/skills/wannado-drl/SKILL.md` (or `AGENTS.md`) for full specifications.

0. **Scope & Handoff (`wannado-adv`)**: Activate `wannado-drl` strictly for MDP modeling, DRL training/auditing, and RL reporting (`./drl_lab/`). Hand off adversarial perturbation attacks cleanly to `./adv_eval/` and preserve frozen `obs_rms_state` (`mean`, `var`) via differentiable PyTorch ops in `VictimInterface`.
1. **Isolate Inside `./drl_lab/`**: Scaffold via `wannado-drl scaffold`, customize single files via `wannado-drl eject <algo_id>`, and expose `reward_terms`, `task_metrics`, and (when constrained) `info['cost']`. Use `wannado-drl inspect .` + `explain_parameters()` when onboarding ambiguous user projects.
2. **Hard Verification Gate (`wannado-drl verify`)**: Never declare an RL run done until `wannado-drl verify --interface ./drl_lab/interface.py --seeds 0 1 2` (or `preflight_env` + `evaluate_drl_suite` / `audit_external_policy` for SB3/PyTorch policies) exits `0` with zero Future-Leakage Probe alerts and zero Stage 3 `RigorAuditReport` red flags.
3. **rliable Reports & Verbatim Provenance**: Save `paper_summary.md` (Bootstrap 95% CIs, pairwise $P(A>B)$, Performance Profiles), `results_overview.png`/`.svg`, and verbatim citations from `OPTIMIZATION_PROVENANCE` / `wannado-drl cite --include-audit-refs`.
